# Fast-tier verify budget (#1509).
#
# The wall clock the driver gives `.pi/verify-cmd-fast` — typecheck plus lint,
# which finishes in seconds. First non-empty, non-comment line, a positive
# number of milliseconds.
#
# This tier exists so a fast failure is caught in seconds AND so a fast run can
# never inherit the suite tier's budget: before #1509 both tiers shared one
# bound and the full run got whatever the fast run left of it. The bound here
# belongs to the fast run alone. Precedence:
# PI_ENSEMBLE_VERIFY_FAST_TIMEOUT_MS → PI_ENSEMBLE_VERIFY_TIMEOUT_MS → this
# file → the documented default (10 min).
600000
